      "vision_reason": "A gilt lacquer/bronze seated Buddha in earth-touching gesture on a lotus pedestal, in the Pagan (Bamar) sculptural style per the museum's own attribution—a devotional image made and used within Bamar Buddhist tradition.",
      "vision_confidence": "HIGH",
